## P18-V01 rebalance API slice

- Checked pinned `RebalanceImpl.getmQClientFactory()` and
  `setmQClientFactory(MQClientInstance)` plus Push/Pull startup assignments via
  `git show` at the pinned source revision.
- Added nullable `get_client_runtime`/`set_client_runtime` behavior to Push and
  Pull owners. The replaceable reference is used by rebalance operations;
  owner registration and lifecycle remain tied to `ClientRuntimeManager`.
  Pull registration reads an explicit owner override through its weak owner
  link and falls back to its registration runtime only while the slot is
  unset, avoiding a strong runtime-registration cycle and preserving direct
  registration tests.
- Added Push and Pull setter tests for runtime identity replacement and
  explicit null. Updated
  `docs/compatibility/PHASE_18_REBALANCE_PROCESS_QUEUE_API.md` with the mapping.

